op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n那個該死的魔王居然敢暗算你，\n真是可惡至極！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n你放心，我一定會替你打倒他！\n讓他還你一個公道！"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,258]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n哈哈……"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[151,54,22,2,0]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n……丞相。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n哦，徐庶，你可来了！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,151,0,54,64,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[151,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n元直发现了通往地下的密道，\n请即刻派兵追击孔明。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n是吗！曹某在此谢过。\n这次真多亏元直鼎力相助。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n元直惶恐……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[151,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n好。\n马上追击孔明。\n这是最后的决战，大家要小心！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[151,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n丞相，元直告辞了……\n&曹操\n嗯。\n这次多亏你了。\n&徐庶\n岂敢，祝丞相马到成功。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[151,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n（吾友孔明……\n如今的我正盼望着你死去。\n你会恨我吗……？）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[151,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n（不……你应该不会怪我的。\n如果你真的还是你的话，\n一定会同意我所做的一切。）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[151,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n（吾友孔明……\n我将诚心地向上苍祈祷，\n只求你能够平静地安息。）"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,151,0,54,22,0]},{"op":49,"name":"actor